UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under IRC Sec. 951A, GILTI equals net CFC tested income minus the deemed tangible income return (DTIR) of 10% of QBAI. DTIR = 10% x $8,000,000 = $800,000. GILTI = $2,000,000 - $800,000 = $1,200,000. The 10% QBAI return represents the routine return on tangible assets excluded from GILTI.
