  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under IRC Sec. 250(b), foreign-derived deduction eligible income (FDDEI) equals foreign-derived gross income minus allocable deductions: $3,000,000 - $1,500,000 = $1,500,000. This FDDEI is the basis for computing the FDII deduction at 37.5%, yielding an effective rate of 13.125%.
